           \"Material cost benchmarks\",\n    37→            ]\n    38→        },\n    39→        {\n    40→            \"name\": \"BID PROCESS AND COMPETITION\",\n    41→            \"items\": [\n    42→                \"Other bidders on this contract (if public)\",\n    43→                \"Similar recent solicitations for comparison\",\n    44→                \"Sole-source justification patterns\",\n    45→                \"Bid protest history\",\n    46→                \"Procurement officer history and patterns\",\n    47→            ]\n    48→        },\n    49→        {\n    50→            \"name\": \"CONTRACT MODIFICATIONS AND OVERRUNS\",\n    51→            \"items\": [\n    52→                \"Change order patterns on similar contracts\",\n    53→                \"Amendment and modification history\",\n    54→                \"Cost overrun statistics in sector\",\n    55→                \"Schedule extension patterns\",\n    56→                \"Scope creep indicators\",\n    57→            ]\n    58→        },\n    59→        {\n    60→            \"name\": \"VENDOR PERFORMANCE HISTORY\",\n    61→            \"items\": [\n    62→                \"Past performance evaluations (PPIRS for federal)\",\n    63→                \"Completed projects: on-time, on-budget?\",\n    64→                \"Quality issues, defects, rework\",\n    65→                \"Customer complaints and disputes\",\n    66→                \"Warranty claims and callbacks\",\n    67→            ]\n    68→        },\n    69→        {\n    70→            \"name\": \"CONNECTED ENTITIES AND CONFLICTS\",\n    71→            \"items\": [\n    72→                \"Subcontractor relationships\",\n    73→                \"Joint venture partners\",\n    74→                \"Related party transactions\",\n    75→                \"Revolving door: former officials now at vendor\",\n    76→                \"Family connections to agency staff\",\n    77→                \"Shell company indicators\",\n  